<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Hillsborough Cty, Fla., COPs.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Hillsborough Cty, Fla., COPs.</headline>
<text>
<p>CERTIFICATES OF PARTICIPATION</p>
<p>RE: $28,000,000</p>
<p>SCHOOL BOARD OF HILLSBOROUGH COUNTY, FLORIDA</p>
<p>(MASTER LEASE PROGRAM), SERIES 1996</p>
<p>WE HAVE RECEIVED THE WRITTEN AWARD.</p>
<p>     MOODY'S: Aaa (MBIA INS)	  S&amp;P: AAA (MBIA INS)</p>
<p>DATED: 10/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT     COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/2017	     28,000M    5.25  %	  5.70</p>
